{"beat": 22, "name": "THE WEST", "text": "And here's the correction most retellings miss. Nothing over a dime was never quite the whole truth. In some districts west of the Rockies, and in Canada, the stores already had a ceiling of 15 cents. Charlton's western stores, part of the merged company, sold at 5, 10 and 15 cents. So the company was running different ceilings in different parts of the same chain, for years. That's the closest thing in this story to a price experiment. But it wasn't designed as one, and prices compared across places can't tell you much about price, because the places differ in many ways besides the price. Hold on to that. It matters later.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.2}, {"word": "here's", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.5}, {"word": "the", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.6}, {"word": "correction", "start": 0.6, "end": 1.02}, {"word": "most", "start": 1.02, "end": 1.4}, {"word": "retellings", "start": 1.4, "end": 2.1}, {"word": "miss.", "start": 2.1, "end": 2.4}, {"word": "Nothing", "start": 3.12, "end": 3.3}, {"word": "over", "start": 3.3, "end": 3.62}, {"word": "a", "start": 3.62, "end": 3.84}, {"word": "dime", "start": 3.84, "end": 4.1}, {"word": "was", "start": 4.1, "end": 4.36}, {"word": "never", "start": 4.36, "end": 4.6}, {"word": "quite", "start": 4.6, "end": 4.92}, {"word": "the", "start": 4.92, "end": 5.1}, {"word": "whole", "start": 5.1, "end": 5.34}, {"word": "truth.", "start": 5.34, "end": 5.72}, {"word": "In", "start": 6.34, "end": 6.52}, {"word": "some", "start": 6.52, "end": 6.8}, {"word": "districts", "start": 6.8, "end": 7.12}, {"word": "west", "start": 7.12, "end": 7.44}, {"word": "of", "start": 7.44, "end": 7.6}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.6, "end": 7.72}, {"word": "Rockies,", "start": 7.72, "end": 8.24}, {"word": "and", "start": 8.24, "end": 8.44}, {"word": "in", "start": 8.44, "end": 8.6}, {"word": "Canada,", "start": 8.6, "end": 9.02}, {"word": "the", "start": 9.44, "end": 9.56}, {"word